[14.1042, "o", "╭──┬────────────┬───────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\n│\u001b[1m#\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mFocus     \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mScore\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mFeedback                                                             \u001b[0m│\r\n├──┼────────────┼───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│1 │ behaviour  │  \u001b[1;31m8/20\u001b[0m │ Right outcome; say what it publishes: a zero Twist, not the last     │\r\n│  │            │       │ command.                                                             │\r\n│2 │ motivation │  \u001b[1;31m0/20\u001b[0m │ Missed: a callback that has stopped firing cannot notice that it     │\r\n│  │            │       │ stopped.                                                             │\r\n│3 │ edge case  │  \u001b[1;31m0/20\u001b[0m │ It matters: the age check uses header.stamp, not arrival time.       │\r\n│4 │ risk       │  \u001b[1;31m0/20\u001b[0m │ Missed: stop_distance is new and 0 turns the obstacle stop off.      │\r\n│5 │ testing    │  \u001b[1;31m4/20\u001b[0m │ Driving it by hand is not a repeatable check; publish synthetic scans│\r\n│  │            │       │ in a test.                                                           │\r\n╰──┴────────────┴───────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[14.1048, "o", "╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\n│ \u001b[1;31mGrip Score: 12/100\u001b[0m  \u001b[1;31mFAIL\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(pass mark 70)\u001b[0m                                                      │\r\n│                                                                                              │\r\n│ You could not explain what this node does when its inputs go quiet. Read the diff again      │\r\n│ before sending it upstream.                                                                  │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
