[24.0257, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2mThe cmd_vel safety filter gains a scan watchdog: with no LaserScan for scan_timeout it publishes\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2ma zero Twist instead of forwarding commands on stale data, and the hard-coded stop distance \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mbecomes the stop_distance parameter.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[24.0261, "o", "\u001b[2mAnswer in a sentence or two. Press Enter on an empty line to skip.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[24.0268, "o", "\u001b[1;36mQ1/5\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(behaviour)\u001b[0m What does the node publish on /cmd_vel once no /scan message has arrived for \r\nlonger than scan_timeout?\r\n"]
[24.027, "o", "\u001b[1m> \u001b[0m"]
