[47.2056, "o", "╭──┬────────────┬───────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\n│\u001b[1m#\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mFocus     \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mScore\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m│\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mFeedback                                                             \u001b[0m│\r\n├──┼────────────┼───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│1 │ behaviour  │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Correct: the watchdog publishes an empty Twist, a full stop, not the │\r\n│  │            │       │ incoming command.                                                    │\r\n│2 │ motivation │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Yes: once scans stop, _on_scan never runs, so the check has to live  │\r\n│  │            │       │ on the path that still executes.                                     │\r\n│3 │ edge case  │ \u001b[1;33m12/20\u001b[0m │ Right, and the consequence: every scan looks older than scan_timeout,│\r\n│  │            │       │ so the watchdog fires on every single command.                       │\r\n│4 │ risk       │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Correct: stop_distance, and at 0 the comparison can never be true, so│\r\n│  │            │       │ the obstacle stop is off.                                            │\r\n│5 │ testing    │ \u001b[1;32m20/20\u001b[0m │ Good: publish fake scans, stop, send a command, assert a zero Twist  │\r\n│  │            │       │ on /cmd_vel.                                                         │\r\n╰──┴────────────┴───────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[47.2063, "o", "╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\n│ \u001b[1;32mGrip Score: 92/100\u001b[0m  \u001b[1;32mPASS\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(pass mark 70)\u001b[0m                                            │\r\n│                                                                                    │\r\n│ Solid grasp of the watchdog, its clock assumptions and the new parameter. Ship it. │\r\n╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
